================================================================================
<===> escaped_keyword/input.scss
// `\74 ` is the letter "t", so this is the keyword `through`
a {
  @for $i from 1 \74 hrough 2 { b: $i; }
}
<===> escaped_keyword/output.css
a {
  b: 1;
  b: 2;
}
